    "description": "Welcome to the world of Animal Onet, where fun and challenge come together! You will join adorable and charming animal characters on an adventure through thrilling stages. Match identical images to unlock higher levels and win rewards. Get ready for an exciting journey with Animal Onet!\r\n\r\n<b>HIGHLIGHTS\r\n\u2b50 Easy and addictive gameplay\r\n\u2b50 Unlimited levels with diverse goals and hurdles\r\n\u2b50 Lively graphics featuring charming animals for endless entertainment\r\n\u2b50 Exciting power-ups to progress faster\r\n\u2b50 Regular updates with new levels and features\r\n\u2b50 Multiple game modes for variety and thrill.\r\n\r\nGet ready to experience the ultimate animal matching puzzle!\r\n\r\n<b>CONTACT US\r\nWe keep updating this game! Please email us if you have any questions or suggestions: happygaming4bro@gmail.com</b></b>",
